---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- ═══════════════ NAVBAR ═══════════════ -->
  <header class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_1px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="flex-shrink-0">
        <img src="/images/logo.svg" alt="Anestesia Digital" class="h-10 w-auto" />
      </a>
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8">
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-8 font-['Montserrat'] text-[15px] font-normal text-[#000000]">
          <a href="#sistema" class="hover:text-[#005BF5] transition-colors">Sistema</a>
          <a href="#planes" class="hover:text-[#005BF5] transition-colors">Planes</a>
          <a href="#garantia" class="hover:text-[#005BF5] transition-colors">Garantía por contrato</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="#contacto" class="bg-[#005BF5] text-[#FFFFFF] font-['Montserrat'] font-bold text-sm px-7 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-[#2760C2] transition-colors shadow-sm">
          Agendar Llamada
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ═══════════════ HERO ═══════════════ -->
  <main class="w-full pt-20 bg-white">
    <div class="flex flex-col w-full">
      <section class="relative w-full min-h-[780px] flex items-center py-20 bg-white overflow-visible">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center relative z-10">

          <!-- ── LEFT COLUMN ── -->
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 relative z-20">
            <h1 class="font-['Montserrat'] text-[42px] md:text-[50px] leading-[1.15] font-extrabold tracking-tight">
              <span class="text-[#39598f]">Haz rentable tu inversión en </span><span class="text-[#2760c2]">publicidad digital</span><span class="text-[#39598f]"> para tu clínica estética</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="font-['Montserrat'] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600 max-w-lg">
              Deja de gastar presupuesto en pauta que solo trae preguntones por WhatsApp. Creamos campañas exclusivas para atraer <strong class="font-bold text-gray-800">Más y mejores pacientes</strong> a tu clínica en México y Perú.
            </p>

            <!-- Buttons -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mt-1">
              <a href="#contacto" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#005BF5] text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-['Montserrat'] font-bold text-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">rocket_launch</span>
                Solicitar plan de crecimiento
              </a>
              <a href="#planes" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-700 px-5 py-3.5 rounded-full font-['Montserrat'] font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">visibility</span>
                Ver Servicio y Paquetes
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Trust Badges -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5 mt-4 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 max-w-lg">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-[#005BF5]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#005BF5] text-[16px]">verified</span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-['Montserrat'] text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700">Meta Certified</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-px h-6 bg-gray-200"></div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-[#005BF5]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#005BF5] text-[16px]">workspace_premium</span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-['Montserrat'] text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700">Google Partner</span>
              </div>
              <div class="w-px h-6 bg-gray-200"></div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-[#005BF5]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#005BF5] text-[16px]">payments</span>
                </div>
                <span class="font-['Montserrat'] text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700">+$100k USD Gestionados</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Dark Guarantee Box -->
            <div class="mt-2 flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#111827] rounded-2xl max-w-lg shadow-lg">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-[#005BF5] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 shadow-[0_0_16px_rgba(0,91,245,0.4)]">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white text-[22px]">shield</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-['Montserrat'] font-bold text-white text-sm mb-1">Garantía por Contrato:</p>
                <p class="font-['Montserrat'] text-gray-400 text-[13px] leading-relaxed">Garantía de Rendimiento: Si no alcanzamos el retorno acordado en el mes 2, reasumimos el 50% de nuestros honorarios.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- ── RIGHT COLUMN: 3D PERSPECTIVE TABLET ── -->
          <div class="relative w-full flex justify-center items-center lg:justify-end mt-12 lg:mt-0" style="perspective: 1200px;">

            <!-- Floating Card: Meta (top-left) -->
            <div class="anime-float absolute -left-4 top-8 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-3 z-30 border border-gray-100" style="transform: translateZ(40px);" data-delay="0">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-[#1877F2] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2.04c-5.5 0-10 4.49-10 10.02 0 5 3.66 9.15 8.44 9.9v-7H7.9v-2.9h2.54V9.85c0-2.51 1.49-3.89 3.78-3.89 1.09 0 2.23.19 2.23.19v2.47h-1.26c-1.24 0-1.63.77-1.63 1.56v1.88h2.78l-.45 2.9h-2.33v7a10 10 0 008.44-9.9c0-5.53-4.5-10.02-10-10.02z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-medium">Meta Ads</p>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-800">52%</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Floating Card: Google Ads (bottom-left) -->
            <div class="anime-float absolute -left-6 bottom-24 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-3 z-30 border border-gray-100" style="transform: translateZ(30px);" data-delay="400">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="#4285F4" d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92a5.06 5.06 0 01-2.2 3.32v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.1z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.07H2.18A10 10 0 001 12c0 1.61.39 3.14 1.08 4.49l3.76-2.4z"/><path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.07l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.53 6.16-4.53z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-medium">Google Ads</p>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-800">32%</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Floating Card: Calendar (bottom-right) -->
            <div class="anime-float absolute -right-2 bottom-16 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-3 z-30 border border-gray-100" style="transform: translateZ(35px);" data-delay="800">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-[#005BF5]/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#005BF5] text-[20px]">calendar_month</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-medium">Próxima cita</p>
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-800">Hoy 3pm</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- TABLET FRAME in 3D perspective -->
            <div class="relative w-full max-w-[520px]" style="transform: rotateY(-12deg) rotateX(6deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;">
              <!-- Tablet body -->
              <div class="bg-white rounded-[1.5rem] shadow-[0_25px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15),0_0_0_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] overflow-hidden border border-gray-200/60" style="transform: translateZ(0);">

                <!-- Dashboard Header -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5 border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/60">
                  <h3 class="font-['Montserrat'] font-bold text-[13px] text-[#39598f]">Resumen General</h3>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-[10px] bg-white border border-gray-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-gray-500 font-medium">Últimos 30 días</span>
                    <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#005BF5] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] font-bold">AD</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="p-5 flex flex-col gap-5">
                  <!-- Metric Cards -->
                  <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl">
                      <p class="text-[9px] text-gray-400 mb-0.5 font-medium">Pacientes Captados</p>
                      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 leading-none"><span id="metric-pacientes">0</span></p>
                      <p class="text-[9px] text-green-500 font-semibold mt-1">↑ 28.4% vs mes ant.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl">
                      <p class="text-[9px] text-gray-400 mb-0.5 font-medium">Costo por Lead</p>
                      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 leading-none">$2.00</p>
                      <p class="text-[9px] text-green-500 font-semibold mt-1">↓ 14.7% de costo</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl">
                      <p class="text-[9px] text-gray-400 mb-0.5 font-medium">Retorno (ROI)</p>
                      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 leading-none"><span id="metric-roi">0</span>%</p>
                      <p class="text-[9px] text-green-500 font-semibold mt-1">↑ 23.7% de retorno</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Charts Row -->
                  <div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-3">
                    <!-- Line Chart -->
                    <div class="col-span-3 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-3 bg-white">
                      <p class="text-[9px] text-gray-400 font-medium mb-2">Rendimiento de Campañas</p>
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 200 60" class="w-full h-16">
                        <defs>
                          <linearGradient id="lineGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#005BF5" stop-opacity="0.15"/>
                            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#005BF5" stop-opacity="0"/>
                          </linearGradient>
                        </defs>
                        <path d="M0,45 C30,35 50,20 80,28 S130,10 160,18 S190,8 200,5 L200,60 L0,60 Z" fill="url(#lineGrad)"/>
                        <path id="svg-line-1" d="M0,45 C30,35 50,20 80,28 S130,10 160,18 S190,8 200,5" fill="none" stroke="#005BF5" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                        <path id="svg-line-2" d="M0,50 C40,48 70,40 100,38 S150,30 180,32 S195,25 200,22" fill="none" stroke="#39598f" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="4 3" opacity="0.5"/>
                      </svg>
                      <div class="flex gap-4 mt-1">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[8px] text-gray-400"><span class="w-2 h-0.5 bg-[#005BF5] rounded"></span>Leads</span>
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[8px] text-gray-400"><span class="w-2 h-0.5 bg-[#39598f] rounded opacity-50"></span>Pacientes</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Donut Chart -->
                    <div class="col-span-2 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-3 bg-white flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                      <div class="relative w-16 h-16">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="w-full h-full -rotate-90">
                          <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="14" fill="none" stroke="#f3f4f6" stroke-width="4"/>
                          <circle class="donut-seg" cx="18" cy="18" r="14" fill="none" stroke="#005BF5" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="0 88" stroke-linecap="round" data-target="45.76"/>
                          <circle class="donut-seg" cx="18" cy="18" r="14" fill="none" stroke="#39598f" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="0 88" stroke-dashoffset="-45.76" stroke-linecap="round" data-target="28.16" data-offset="-45.76"/>
                          <circle class="donut-seg" cx="18" cy="18" r="14" fill="none" stroke="#2760c2" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="0 88" stroke-dashoffset="-73.92" stroke-linecap="round" data-target="14.08" data-offset="-73.92"/>
                        </svg>
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
                          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-800">62%</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 mt-2 text-[7px] text-gray-500">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#005BF5] rounded-full"></span>Meta 52%</span>
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#39598f] rounded-full"></span>Google 32%</span>
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#2760c2] rounded-full"></span>Web 16%</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Campaigns Table -->
                  <div class="border border-gray-100 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
                    <table class="w-full text-left text-[9px]">
                      <thead class="bg-gray-50/80">
                        <tr class="text-gray-400">
                          <th class="py-2 px-3 font-medium">Campaña</th>
                          <th class="py-2 px-3 font-medium">Canal</th>
                          <th class="py-2 px-3 font-medium">Leads</th>
                          <th class="py-2 px-3 font-medium">Pac.</th>
                          <th class="py-2 px-3 font-medium">Conv.</th>
                          <th class="py-2 px-3 font-medium text-right">Revenue</th>
                        </tr>
                      </thead>
                      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-50 text-gray-600">
                        <tr>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Convertidores - Cirugía</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3">Meta</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3">48</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3">12</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3 text-green-500 font-semibold">24.2%</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right font-bold text-gray-800">$46,750</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Simplicity - Bótox</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3">Google</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3">35</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3">8</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3 text-green-500 font-semibold">21.3%</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right font-bold text-gray-800">—</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3 font-semibold text-gray-700">Aumento Mamario</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3">Meta</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3">24</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3">6</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3 text-green-500 font-semibold">18.7%</td>
                          <td class="py-2 px-3 text-right font-bold text-gray-800">—</td>
                        </tr>
                      </tbody>
                    </table>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- 3D Shelf / Podium -->
              <div class="mt-4 mx-auto w-[90%] h-3 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-200 to-gray-100 rounded-[100%] shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]"></div>
              <div class="mx-auto w-[70%] h-2 bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-100 to-transparent rounded-[100%] opacity-60"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section><section class="w-full py-20 bg-surface-container-lowest">
<div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-16">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
<span class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-primary"></span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-primary uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">LA REALIDAD DEL MARKETING MÉDICO TRADICIONAL</span>
<span class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-primary"></span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary mb-4 font-extrabold">¿Por qué tu publicidad actual solo atrae curioseadores?</h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl font-normal">La mayoría de las agencias se enfocan en traer volumen de mensajes vacíos, no pacientes rentables.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter">
<!-- Card 1 -->
<div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-secondary/30 flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">person_search</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-secondary font-bold">Curiosos sin Presupuesto</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant font-normal">Tu WhatsApp se llena de mensajes pidiendo "precio", pero casi nadie agenda una valoración ni paga un procedimiento de alto valor.</p>
</div>
<!-- Card 2 -->
<div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-secondary/30 flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">visibility_off</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-secondary font-bold">Inversión a Ciegas</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant font-normal">Inviertes presupuesto en pauta publicitaria todos los meses sin saber con claridad cuántas consultas reales te genera cada dólar.</p>
</div>
<!-- Card 3 -->
<div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-secondary/30 flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">domain_disabled</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-secondary font-bold">Agencias Generalistas</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant font-normal">Trabajas con agencias que no conocen la regulación médica ni el comportamiento del paciente de medicina estética y cirugía plástica.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section class="w-full py-20 bg-primary">
<div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
<div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-16">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
<span class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-white"></span>
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-white uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">NUESTRA SOLUCIÓN ESPECIALIZADA</span>
<span class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-white"></span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-white mb-4 font-extrabold">Un sistema de captación diseñado para el sector médico estético.</h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-white max-w-2xl font-normal">Nos enfocamos en lo que realmente importa: aumentar el retorno de tu inversión en publicidad digital y transformar tráfico en procedimientos realizados.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter">
<!-- Card 1 -->
<div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">campaign</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-secondary font-bold">Publicidad en Redes Sociales (Meta Ads)</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant font-normal">Estructuramos y optimizamos tus campañas en Facebook e Instagram para dirigir el tráfico hacia pacientes con capacidad de pago, evitando el desperdicio de presupuesto en mensajes sin valor.</p>
</div>
<!-- Card 2 -->
<div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">search</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-secondary font-bold">Posicionamiento en Buscadores (Google Ads)</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant font-normal">Captamos a pacientes con intención de compra inmediata que están buscando activamente tus tratamientos o cirugías en Google, conectándolos directamente con tu clínica.</p>
</div>
<!-- Card 3 -->
<div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">web</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-secondary font-bold">Páginas Web de Alta Conversión</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant font-normal">Diseñamos landing pages rápidas, modernas y persuasivas, pensadas exclusivamente para proyectar autoridad médica y convertir visitas en procedimientos realizados.</p>
</div>
<!-- Card 4 -->
<div class="bg-surface p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
